# Line endings.
#
# The repo is worked on from Windows, where git's autocrlf hands files to tools
# with CRLF. That is fine for most things and not fine for the workflow scripts:
# the permission dialog that approves a workflow refuses a script containing
# carriage returns, so a round would not start at all until the file was
# converted by hand. Pin the files that have to be LF, and normalise the rest so
# the repo stays consistent whoever checks it out.

* text=auto

.claude/workflows/*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
